<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns Ba3 rating to Romanian samurais.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns Ba3 rating to Romanian samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Tuesday that it had assigned its Ba3 rating to the National Bank of Romania's 30 billion yen worth of samurai bonds due in October 2001.</p>
<p>The statement by the rating agency gave no further details.</p>
</text>
